    "teacherReflection": "Did learners correctly identify corresponding sides before calculating, especially in the shadow diagram? How many still added instead of multiplying, and what evidence helped them change? Which learners could explain why the sun's rays create similar triangles? Did the cost question emerge from learners themselves? Note groups who need more practice with image/object order and unit consistency before Lesson 6.",
